{
 "schema_version": 1,
 "contract": "workspace-manifest-vectors",
 "decision": "H77",
 "status": "proposed",
 "description": "Shared positive and negative vectors for the manifest checker (schema_version 1 and proposed 2). Go (apps/whr), scripts/check_repo.py and, after a reviewed resolver change, the host agent read the same file. Cases with document are JSON values; bytes_hex are raw file bytes; raw_text is literal text to parse. expect_codes are the manifest.* finding codes of contracts/cli/validate-findings.json for the manifest alone (an empty list means valid). This initial set is authored with the spec amendment; work items extend it, and a change needs a reviewed decision. Ownership: T028 owns this file. A case is added only if the checkers that exist at that time (the T026 Go checker and scripts/check_repo.py) pass it; later work items that make additional cases visible to Go extend it through their own reviewed change. Type-exact comparison is required: true is not 1, 1.0 and 1e0 are not 1.",
